    description: "Wave 5 of WI-runod cross-axis schedule shipped 6 PRs in 2026-05-06 session: Codeberg #3572 (PR #1: websocket / tauri / grpc / openapi) + selfh #162-166 (PRs #2-6, via failover). Folded ~75 evidence_type + ~28 Symbol.kind values across audit-findings 0013 (Cluster D framework roles) and 0014 (Cluster C framework dispatch). framework_patterns.py Pattern.matches() extended with framework_role meta fallback for backward-compat with existing YAML rules.\n\nCHANGELOG.md [Unreleased] currently documents Phase 1/2 (registry + consumer migration prep) but not the Wave 5 producer-migration completion. Add entries summarising:\n- Per-PR scope (commit SHA + brief description per Wave 5 PR)\n- Aggregate values folded\n- Pattern.matches() backward-compat note\n- Pointer to audit-findings 0013/0014\n\nThis is a routine documentation task; should land before next release (per Pre-Commit playbook §3 'feature status changed: Update CHANGELOG.md')."  # 5adc
